ency is rated 4.\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality 4; Text-to-Video Alignment 4; Physical Consistency 4.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
